    "body": "I don't see any discussion last time about escaping trailing spaces. I suggested escaping _all_ spaces, but that was considered likely incompatible with the web. I think it should be fine.\r\n\r\nThat said, I would suggest that we escape all trailing spaces (not just the final trailing space). I can't imagine that escaping just the final space would be any better for compatibility.",
