    "body": "https://software.hixie.ch/utilities/js/live-dom-viewer/saved/12022 demonstrates this issue using XMLHttpRequest. Gecko strips trailing spaces and Chromium/WebKit do not (none escape). Perhaps this lack of interoperability suggests we have some freedom here to do something better?\r\n\r\n@achristensen07 @valenting @hayatoito thoughts?",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
