    "updated_at": "2024-12-02T08:57:03Z",
    "body": "I put up #844 which removes trailing U+0020 from opaque paths during parsing. Now that all browsers have a good handle on non-special URLs it seems like a good time to be fixing this (modulo having to wait a bit for Interop 2024 results to be frozen).",
