    "created_at": "2025-03-11T08:56:46Z",
    "updated_at": "2025-03-11T08:56:46Z",
    "body": "I am supportive of this effort. This is a worthy goal, and if we can ensure roundtrip for opaque URLs while not breaking anything (for consumers, ie JS and data URLs still work), I don't see any reason why Firefox wouldn't implement this. 👍‍‍",
